    why: "Monterrey stoner-doom — Mexico's Wacken Metal Battle national winner. Heavy fuzz and riff worship that carried them from the local scene all the way to Wacken." },
  { name: 'God-Kings', interview: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8uTBXfNcH_c', scene: 'Global Metal', match: 'god-king', photos: 'https://www.pinterest.com/TheMusicCitiesPodcast/buried-alive-festival-las-rosas-miami/god-kings/',
