    why: "All-women Japanese three-piece working the Tokyo circuit hard — three headline dates this fall and a spot on NEMOPHILA's Ten Fes bill." },
  { name: 'East Of Eden', scene: 'Japanese Metal', match: 'east of eden',
    why: "All-women Japanese metal that puts a violin out front alongside the guitars. On the Ten Fes bill at EX THEATER ROPPONGI." },
  { name: 'NEK!', scene: 'Japanese Metal', match: 'nek!',
    why: "Newest name on the watch list — picked up off NEMOPHILA's Ten Fes lineup, sharing a stage with East Of Eden and TRiDENT." },
